  "goodToKnow": "Die Versöhnung is reconciliation: nach einem Streit, between countries or communities. The Élysée Treaty of 1963, signed by Adenauer and de Gaulle, sealed Franco-German reconciliation after centuries of war; in 1984 Kohl and Mitterrand held hands at Verdun. Willy Brandt's kneeling in Warsaw (1970) became a symbol of reconciliation with Poland. Sich versöhnen means to make up. Plural: die Versöhnungen."
